Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Every family has a beginning. Ours\Nbegins at the old walls of Harar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My great-grandparents came here as\Nstrangers, carrying little more than a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They were tailors. Stitch by stitch,\Nthey built a life with their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandmother kept a small stall by the\Nstreet. The stitches became trade, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the trade became a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What she earned, she saved, for the ones\Nwho would come after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother worked in the market by day,\Nand carried her schoolbooks with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At night, when she was tired, she\Nstudied anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.83,0:00:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And one day, she graduated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she worked long hours in an office,\Nand gave everything she had so that I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,could learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I graduated in software engineering with\Nhonours, won a scholarship for my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,master's, and today I am an AI engineer,\Nwith comforts they never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I have is mine alone. It is the\Nwork of everyone who came before me. Now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,it is my turn to take us a little\Nfurther.
